ge on North Rouse Avenue, where Ellis Marsh, a ski patroller tired of tools that rattled loose by February, ground the first Talus blades by hand."}</p><p className={"m-0"}>{"The store on East Main Street followed in 2017, then the repair bench in the back. Today eleven of us design, test, sell and fix everything on the shelves, and every piece is carried on a real trip before it gets a price tag."}</p><p className={"m-0 font-semibold text-[var(--color-text)]"}>{"The lifetime warranty is not a promotion. It is how we find out what to build better."}</p></div></div></section><section className={"section custom-band"} aria-labelledby={"os1-years-title"}><div className={"container"}><div data-anim={"fade-up"}><p className={"eyebrow mb-3"}>{"Since 2014"}</p><h2 id={"os1-years-title"} className={"m-0 text-[clamp(1.875rem,1.4rem+1.5vw,2.75rem)] leading-[1.02]"}>{"From a garage to the bench"}</h2></div><ol className={"custom-years mt-8"} role={"list"} data-anim-stagger={"80"}><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-year"}>{"2014"}</span><strong>{"The first Talus"}</strong><span>{"Forty knives ground in a Rouse Avenue garage, sold to friends on ski patrol."}</span></li><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-year"}>{"2016"}</span><strong>{"Kodiak 14"}</strong><span>{"A multitool built to be taken apart with one driver. Still our best seller."}</span></li><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-year"}>{"2017"}</span><strong>{"East Main Street"}</strong><span>{"The store opens with rentals, fittings and Saturday sharpening."}</span></li><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-year"}>{"2019"}</span><strong>{"For life"}</strong><span>{"The lifetime warranty and the repair bench, with free labels both ways."}</span></li><li data-anim={"fade-up"}><span className={"custom-year"}>{"2026"}</span><strong>{"4,812 repairs"}</strong><span>{"Tools back on the trail in 2026, in six days on average."}</span></li></ol></div></section><section className={"section"} aria-labelledby={"os1-rules-title"}><div className={"container"}><div data-anim={"fade-up"}><p className={"eyebrow mb-3"}>{"How We Work"}</p><h2 id={"os1-rules-title"} className={"m-0 text-[clamp(1.875rem,1.4rem+1.5vw,2.75rem)] leading-[1.02]"}>{"Three rules on the workshop wall"}</h2></div><ul className={"mt-8 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-3"} role={"list"} data-anim-stagger={"80"}><li className={"custom-step"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><i className={"ph ph-wrench custom-step-icon"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><strong>{"Built to be repaired"}</strong><span>{"Screws instead of rivets, parts we keep in stock, and drawings the bench can work from in twenty years."}</span></li><li className={"custom-step"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><i className={"ph ph-mountains custom-step-icon"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><strong>{"Carried before it is sold"}</strong><span>{"Every piece spends a season on staff trips in the Gallatin and Bridger ranges before it reaches the shelf."}</span></li><li className={"custom-step"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><i className={"ph ph-scales custom-step-icon"} aria-hidden={"true"}></i><strong>{"Fewer, better things"}</strong><span>{"Twenty-eight pieces, not two thousand. If a tool does not earn its weight, it does not come along."}</span></li></ul></div></section><section className={"section pt-0"} aria-labelledby={"os1-founder-title"}><div className={"container grid items-center gap-x-16 gap-y-10 md:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.75fr)_minmax(0,1.25fr)] lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.6fr)_minmax(0,1.4fr)]"}><figure className={"custom-founder-photo m-0"} data-anim={"fade-up"}><img src={"https://draftmango.com/draftmango/assets/media/placeholder/800x800.svg"} alt={"Ellis Marsh, founder of Draftmango Outdoor"} width={"800"} height={"800"} loading={"lazy"} decoding={"async"} /></figure><div data-anim={"fade-up"} data-anim-delay={"120"}><p className={"eyebrow mb-3"}>{"The Founder"}</p><h2 id={"os1-founder-title"} className={"sr-only"}>{"Ellis Marsh, founder"}</h2><blockquot